\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"May 5, 2020 12:00:55 AM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"May 5, 2020 12:00:55 AM\",\"content\":\"The submission session is now available for: LC-SC3-CC-7-2020(RIA), LC-SC3-NZE-6-2020(RIA), LC-SC3-CC-1-2018-2019-2020(RIA), LC-SC3-RES-20-2020(IA), LC-SC3-SCC-2-2020(ERA-NET-Cofund), LC-SC3-RES-3-2020(RIA), LC-SC3-RES-25-2020(RIA), LC-SC3-RES-34-2020(IA), LC-SC3-RES-36-2020(RIA), LC-SC3-ES-13-2020(IA)\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Apr 28, 2020 5:28:20 PM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Apr 28, 2020 5:28:20 PM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eOn 28 April 2020, a total of 266 proposals were submitted in response to the following topics:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eLC-SC3-JA-5-2020 (RIA): 8 proposals\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\nLC-SC3-RES-10-2020 (PCP): 4 proposals\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\nLC-SC3-RES-1-2019-2020 (RIA): 144 proposals\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\nLC-SC3-RES-18-2020 (RIA-LS): 13 proposals\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\nLC-SC3-RES-26-2020 (RIA): 43 proposals\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\nLC-SC3-RES-31-2020 (RIA): 29 proposals\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\nLC-SC3-RES-32-2020 (RIA): 7 proposals\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\nLC-SC3-RES-37-2020 (RIA): 18 proposals\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Apr 7, 2020 11:32:38 AM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Apr 7, 2020 11:32:38 AM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePlease note that due to COVID-19, the topics of this call with a deadline on 21 April are postponed to 28 April 2020. The topics concerned by this update are:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003ctable border\\u003d\\\"1\\\" width\\u003d\\\"0\\\" cellspacing\\u003d\\\"0\\\" cellpadding\\u003d\\\"0\\\"\\u003e\\n\\u003ctbody\\u003e\\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"179\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eLC-SC3-RES-1-2019-2020\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"415\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eDeveloping the next generation of renewable energy technologies\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"68\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eRIA\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\n\\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"179\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eLC-SC3-RES-18-2020\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"415\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAdvanced drilling and well completion techniques for cost reduction in geothermal energy\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"68\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eRIA-LS\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\n\\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"179\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eLC-SC3-RES-31-2020\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"415\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOffshore wind basic science and balance of plant\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"68\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eRIA\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\n\\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"179\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eLC-SC3-RES-32-2020\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"415\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eNew test rig devices for accelerating ocean energy technology development\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"68\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eRIA\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\n\\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"179\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eLC-SC3-RES-26-2020\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"415\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eDevelopment of next generation renewable fuel technologies from CO2 and renewable energy (Power and Energy to Renewable Fuels)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"68\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eRIA\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\u003c/tr\\u003e\\n\\u003ctr\\u003e\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"179\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eLC-SC3-RES-37-2020\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"415\\\"\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eCombined clean biofuel production and phytoremediation solutions from contaminated lands worldwide\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/td\\u003e\\n\\u003ctd width\\u003d\\\"68\\\"\\u003e\\u003c