sans-serif; color: black; line-height: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: \\u0026quot;Times New Roman\\u0026quot;; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: FR-BE; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-B4E-10-2020 \\u003c/span\\u003e(IA):\\u0026nbsp;8 proposals\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cspan lang\\u003d\\\"EN-US\\\" style\\u003d\\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: \\u0026quot;Calibri\\u0026quot;,sans-serif; color: black; line-height: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: \\u0026quot;Times New Roman\\u0026quot;; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: FR-BE; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-B4E-12-2020 \\u003c/span\\u003e(CSA):\\u0026nbsp;13 proposals\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cspan lang\\u003d\\\"EN-US\\\" style\\u003d\\\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: \\u0026quot;Calibri\\u0026quot;,sans-serif; color: black; line-height: 115%; mso-fareast-font-family: \\u0026quot;Times New Roman\\u0026quot;; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: FR-BE; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-EC-4-2020 \\u003c/span\\u003e(RIA):\\u0026nbsp;12 proposals\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Jan 16, 2020 5:34:46 PM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Jan 16, 2020 5:34:46 PM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eOn 11 December 2019, a total of 69 proposals were submitted in response to the following topics: \\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003eLC-SC3-RES-9-2020 (IA): 10 proposals\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\r\\nLC-SC3-RES-19-2020 (IA): 14 proposals\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\r\\nLC-SC3-RES-33-2020 (IA): 11 proposals\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\r\\nLC-SC3-RES-35-2020 (IA): 9 proposals\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\r\\nLC-SC3-RES-28-2018-2019-2020 (CSA): 20 proposals\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\r\\nLC-SC3-RES-27-2020 (IA): 5 proposals\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Jan 8, 2020 4:32:00 PM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Jan 8, 2020 4:32:00 PM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp class\\u003d\\\"MsoNormal\\\"\\u003e\\u003ci\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"EN-US\\\"\\u003eThe  European Commission, in agreement with the Department of Science \\u0026amp;  Technology (DST), India, intends to cancel\\u0026nbsp;the topic\\u0026nbsp;\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/opportunities/topic-details/lc-sc3-es-12-2020\\\" target\\u003d\\\"_blank\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-ES-12-2020\\u003c/a\\u003e:  \\u0026ldquo;Integrated local energy systems (Energy islands): International  cooperation with India\\u0026rdquo; and plans to publish a new topic with the same  thematic scope but with adjusted formal requirements as regards the  international cooperation between EU and Indian entities.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/i\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp class\\u003d\\\"MsoNormal\\\"\\u003e\\u003ci\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"EN-US\\\"\\u003eThe  Commission and DST intend to call for proposals for the new topic in  May 2020 with a submission deadline on 1 September 2020. This  cancellation and publication of a new topic will be confirmed once all  necessary procedural steps are finalized\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/i\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"EN-US\\\"\\u003e. \\u003cem\\u003e(It is foreseen that the update of the Work Programme will be published in the first quarter of 2020).\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003cbr /\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp class\\u003d\\\"MsoNormal\\\"\\u003e\\u003ci\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"EN-US\\\"\\u003eIndian applicants are recommended to access \\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"color:#203864\\\"\\u003e\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"http://www.dst.gov.in\\\"\\u003ewww.dst.gov.in\\u003c/a\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003efor further details.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/i\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp class\\u003d\\\"MsoNormal\\\"\\u003e\\u003ci\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"EN-US\\\"\\u003eAs of December 20, 2019, the submission platform is no more accessible for this topic\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/i\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"EN-US\\\"\\u003e.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp class\\u003d\\\"MsoNormal\\\"\\u003e\\u003ci\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"EN-US\\\"\\u003ePotential   applicants who had already created a draft proposal prior to this date   can still access it, in view of archiving/saving their data only. They   should not continue drafting or submit these drafts, as no data will  be  transferred to the new topic that will replace LC-SC3-ES-12-2020. A  new  proposal will have to be created then.\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/i\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Dec 3, 2019 12:30:56 AM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Dec 3, 2019 12:30:56 AM\",\"content\":\"The submission session is now available for: LC-SC3-RES-18-2020(RIA-LS), LC-SC3-RES-32-2020(RIA), LC-SC3-RES-1-2019-2020(RIA), LC-SC3-RES-37-2020(RIA), LC-SC3-RES-26-2020(RIA), LC-SC3-RES-31-2020(RIA)\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Oct 17, 2019 2:17:24 PM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Oct 17, 2019 2:17:24 PM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eOn 27 August 2019, a total of 15 proposals were submitted in response to the following topics:\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003eLC-SC3-CC-3-2019 (CSA): 11 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-JA-2-2018-2019 (CSA): 1 proposal\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-JA-3-2019-2020 (PCP): 3 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Sep 26, 2019 12:30:21 AM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Sep 26, 2019 12:30:21 AM\",\"content\":\"The submission session is now available for: LC-SC3-JA-5-2020(RIA), LC-SC3-RES-10-2020(PCP)\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Sep 11, 2019 9:17:32 AM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Sep 11, 2019 9:17:32 AM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eOn 10 September 2019, a total of\\u0026nbsp;279 proposals were submitted in response to the following topics:\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003eLC-SC3-EE-1-2018-2019-2020 (IA):\\u0026nbsp;29 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-EE-2-2018-2019 (CSA): 22 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-EE-3-2019-2020 (CSA): 13 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-EE-4-2019-2020 (IA): 29 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-EE-5-2018-2019-2020 (IA): 9 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-EE-6-2018-2019-2020 (CSA): 7 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-EE-8-2018-2019 (CSA): 15 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-EE-9-2018-2019 (CSA): 14 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-EE-10-2018-2019-2020 (CSA): 9 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-EE-11-2018-2019-2020 (CSA): 22 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-EE-13-2018-2019-2020 (IA): 16 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-EE-14-2018-2019-2020 (RIA): 11 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-EE-16-2018-2019-2020 (CSA): 35 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-EE-18-2019 (CSA): 11 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space: pre\\\"\\u003e \\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"wh