arent:\\\"\\\";\\r\\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\\r\\nmso-para-margin:0cm;\\r\\nmso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt;\\r\\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan;\\r\\nfont-size:10.0pt;\\r\\nfont-family:\\\"Times New Roman\\\",serif;}\\r\\n\\u003c/style\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c![endif]--\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Aug 2, 2019 10:00:40 AM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Aug 2, 2019 10:00:40 AM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThe submission deadline of 03 September 2019 in the\\u0026nbsp;H2020-LC-SC3-EE-2019 call has been extended to\\u0026nbsp;10 September 2019 at 17:00 (Brussels local time). This extension applies to the following topics:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-1-2018-2019-2020(IA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e-\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-2-2018-2019(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e-\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-3-2019-2020(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e-\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-4-2019-2020(IA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-5-2018-2019-2020(IA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-6-2018-2019-2020(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-8-2018-2019(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-9-2018-2019(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-10-2018-2019-2020(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-11-2018-2019-2020(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-13-2018-2019-2020(IA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-14-2018-2019-2020(RIA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-16-2018-2019-2020(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-18-2019(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EC-1-2018-2019-2020(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EC-2-2018-2019-2020(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Jul 16, 2019 8:20:22 AM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Jul 16, 2019 8:20:22 AM\",\"content\":\"The submission session is now available for: LC-SC3-EC-4-2020(RIA), LC-SC3-B4E-1-2020(CSA), LC-SC3-B4E-5-2020(IA), LC-SC3-B4E-6-2020(IA), LC-SC3-B4E-8-2020(IA), LC-SC3-B4E-7-2020(CSA), LC-SC3-B4E-10-2020(IA), LC-SC3-B4E-12-2020(CSA), LC-SC3-B4E-9-2020(CSA)\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Jul 3, 2019 8:34:02 AM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Jul 3, 2019 8:34:02 AM\",\"content\":\"The submission session is now available for: LC-SC3-EE-16-2018-2019-2020(CSA), LC-SC3-EE-1-2018-2019-2020(IA), LC-SC3-EE-11-2018-2019-2020(CSA), LC-SC3-EE-6-2018-2019-2020(CSA), LC-SC3-EE-2-2018-2019(CSA), LC-SC3-EE-3-2019-2020(CSA), LC-SC3-EE-14-2018-2019-2020(RIA), LC-SC3-EE-8-2018-2019(CSA), LC-SC3-EE-9-2018-2019(CSA), LC-SC3-EE-13-2018-2019-2020(IA), LC-SC3-EE-5-2018-2019-2020(IA), LC-SC3-EE-4-2019-2020(IA), LC-SC3-EE-18-2019(CSA), LC-SC3-EC-2-2018-2019-2020(CSA), LC-SC3-EC-1-2018-2019-2020(CSA), LC-SC3-EE-10-2018-2019-2020(CSA)\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Jan 29, 2019 2:23:40 PM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Jan 29, 2019 2:23:40 PM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA FAQ has been published in the \\u0026quot;Additional documents\\u0026quot; section of the topic LC-SC3-ES-8-2019.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Jan 23, 2019 11:04:28 AM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Jan 23, 2019 11:04:28 AM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePlease note that the latest information on results (\\u003cstrong\\u003eFlash Call Info\\u003c/strong\\u003e) for topics LC-SC3-EE-1-2018-2019-2020,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-2-2018-2019, LC-SC3-EE-5-2018-2019-2020, LC-SC3-EE-6-2018-2019-2020,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-8-2018-2019,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-9-2018-2019,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-10-2018-2019-2020,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-11-2018-2019-2020,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-13-2018-2019-2020,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-14-2018-2019-2020,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-15-2018,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-16-2018-2019-2020,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EC-1-2018-2019-2020 and\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EC-2-2018-2019-2020\\u0026nbsp;(that closed on 13\\u0026nbsp;September 2018) can be found in the \\u0026quot;Additional Documents\\u0026quot; section of the relevant topics.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Jan 14, 2019 12:02:04 PM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Jan 14, 2019 12:02:04 PM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePlease note that the latest information on results (\\u003cstrong\\u003eFlash Call Info\\u003c/strong\\u003e)   of the \\u003cstrong\\u003efirst stage\\u003c/strong\\u003e   evaluation for topics LC-SC3-RES-1-2019 and LC-SC3-RES-14-2019 (that  closed  on 16 October 2018) can  be found in the  \\u0026quot;Additional Documents\\u0026quot;  section of  the relevant topics.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003eFor successful applicants invited at stage 2 for these topics, please note that the \\u003cstrong\\u003egeneralised feedback\\u003c/strong\\u003e  with tips on how to improve your proposal is now also available in the   \\u0026quot;Additional Documents\\u0026quot; section of  the respective topics.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThe possibility to work in the submission system on the full proposal should be activated as of tomorrow.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Dec 20, 2018 10:34:53 AM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Dec 20, 2018 10:34:53 AM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePlease note that the latest information on results (\\u003cstrong\\u003eFlash Call Info\\u003c/strong\\u003e)\\u0026nbsp; for topics\\u0026nbsp;  \\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:FR-BE\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"FR-BE\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-NZE-1-2018\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:FR-BE\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"FR-BE\\\"\\u003eCE-SC3-NZE-2-2018\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:FR-BE\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"FR-BE\\\"\\u003e,LC-SC3-NZE-3-2018\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:FR-BE\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"FR-BE\\\"\\u003e,LC-SC3-CC-1-2018-2019-2020\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:FR-BE\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"FR-BE\\\"\\u003e,LC-SC3-CC-2-2018\\u003c/span\\u003e,LC-SC3-CC-5-2018,LC-SC3-CC-6-2018\\u003c!--[if gte mso 9]\\u003e\\u003cxml\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:WordDocument\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:View\\u003eNormal\\u003c/w:V