"The submission session is now available for: LC-SC3-RES-17-2019(IA), LC-SC3-RES-15-2019(IA), LC-SC3-RES-8-2019(IA), LC-SC3-RES-30-2019(IA), LC-SC3-RES-28-2018-2019-2020(CSA), LC-SC3-RES-24-2019(IA)\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Aug 29, 2018 2:41:49 PM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Aug 29, 2018 2:41:49 PM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eAll 47 proposals invited to the second stage of the two-stage topics of this call have been submitted by the call deadline (28 August 2018). The detail per topic is:\\u003co:p\\u003e\\u003c/o:p\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style\\u003d\\\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\\\"\\u003e\\u003cspan lang\\u003d\\\"FR-BE\\\"\\u003e-LC-SC3-RES-4-2018 (RIA): 21 proposals\\u003co:p\\u003e\\u003c/o:p\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp style\\u003d\\\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt\\\"\\u003e\\u003cspan lang\\u003d\\\"FR-BE\\\"\\u003e-LC-SC3-RES-11-2018 (RIA): 26 proposals \\u003co:p\\u003e\\u003c/o:p\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp class\\u003d\\\"MsoNormal\\\"\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan lang\\u003d\\\"FR-BE\\\"\\u003e\\u003co:p\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/o:p\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Aug 23, 2018 11:56:57 AM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Aug 23, 2018 11:56:57 AM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp class\\u003d\\\"MsoNormal\\\"\\u003eDue to some technical issues related to the participant register, the submission deadline of 23 August 2018 in the\\u0026nbsp;H2020-LC-SC3-2018-RES-TwoStages (2\\u003csup\\u003end\\u003c/sup\\u003e stage) call has been postponed to\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"font-size:10.0pt;\\u0026#10;line-height:115%;font-family:\\u0026quot;Arial\\u0026quot;,\\u0026quot;sans-serif\\u0026quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\\\"\\u003e \\u003cb\\u003e28 August 2018, 17:00:00 (Brussels Local Time).\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e This extension applies to the following topics:\\u003co:p\\u003e\\u003c/o:p\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp class\\u003d\\\"MsoNormal\\\"\\u003e- LC-SC3-RES-4-2018 (RIA)\\u003co:p\\u003e\\u003c/o:p\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp class\\u003d\\\"MsoNormal\\\"\\u003e- LC-SC3-RES-11-2018 (RIA)\\u003co:p\\u003e\\u003c/o:p\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Aug 8, 2018 3:12:56 PM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Aug 8, 2018 3:12:56 PM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThe submission deadline of 04 September 2018 in the\\u0026nbsp;H2020-LC-SC3-EE-2018 call has been extended to\\u0026nbsp;13 September 2018 at 17:00 (Brussels local time). This extension applies to the following topics:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-1-2018-2019-2020(IA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e-\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-2-2018-2019(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-5-2018-2019-2020(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-6-2018-2019-2020(IA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-8-2018-2019(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-9-2018-2019(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-10-2018-2019-2020(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-11-2018-2019-2020(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-13-2018-2019-2020(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-14-2018-2019-2020(RIA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-15-2018(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EE-16-2018-2019-2020(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EC-1-2018-2019-2020(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003e- LC-SC3-EC-2-2018-2019-2020(CSA)\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Aug 8, 2018 10:58:46 AM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Aug 8, 2018 10:58:46 AM\",\"content\":\"The submission session is now available for: LC-SC3-EE-16-2018-2019-2020(CSA), LC-SC3-EE-1-2018-2019-2020(IA), LC-SC3-EE-11-2018-2019-2020(CSA), LC-SC3-EE-15-2018(CSA), LC-SC3-EE-5-2018-2019-2020(CSA), LC-SC3-EE-2-2018-2019(CSA), LC-SC3-EE-14-2018-2019-2020(RIA), LC-