3:40 PM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA FAQ has been published in the \\u0026quot;Additional documents\\u0026quot; section of the topic LC-SC3-ES-8-2019.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Jan 23, 2019 11:04:28 AM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Jan 23, 2019 11:04:28 AM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePlease note that the latest information on results (\\u003cstrong\\u003eFlash Call Info\\u003c/strong\\u003e) for topics LC-SC3-EE-1-2018-2019-2020,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-2-2018-2019, LC-SC3-EE-5-2018-2019-2020, LC-SC3-EE-6-2018-2019-2020,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-8-2018-2019,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-9-2018-2019,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-10-2018-2019-2020,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-11-2018-2019-2020,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-13-2018-2019-2020,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-14-2018-2019-2020,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-15-2018,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EE-16-2018-2019-2020,\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EC-1-2018-2019-2020 and\\u0026nbsp;LC-SC3-EC-2-2018-2019-2020\\u0026nbsp;(that closed on 13\\u0026nbsp;September 2018) can be found in the \\u0026quot;Additional Documents\\u0026quot; section of the relevant topics.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Jan 14, 2019 12:02:04 PM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Jan 14, 2019 12:02:04 PM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePlease note that the latest information on results (\\u003cstrong\\u003eFlash Call Info\\u003c/strong\\u003e)   of the \\u003cstrong\\u003efirst stage\\u003c/strong\\u003e   evaluation for topics LC-SC3-RES-1-2019 and LC-SC3-RES-14-2019 (that  closed  on 16 October 2018) can  be found in the  \\u0026quot;Additional Documents\\u0026quot;  section of  the relevant topics.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003eFor successful applicants invited at stage 2 for these topics, please note that the \\u003cstrong\\u003egeneralised feedback\\u003c/strong\\u003e  with tips on how to improve your proposal is now also available in the   \\u0026quot;Additional Documents\\u0026quot; section of  the respective topics.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThe possibility to work in the submission system on the full proposal should be activated as of tomorrow.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Dec 20, 2018 10:34:53 AM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Dec 20, 2018 10:34:53 AM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePlease note that the latest information on results (\\u003cstrong\\u003eFlash Call Info\\u003c/strong\\u003e)\\u0026nbsp; for topics\\u0026nbsp;  \\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:FR-BE\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"FR-BE\\\"\\u003eLC-SC3-NZE-1-2018\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:FR-BE\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"FR-BE\\\"\\u003eCE-SC3-NZE-2-2018\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:FR-BE\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"FR-BE\\\"\\u003e,LC-SC3-NZE-3-2018\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:FR-BE\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"FR-BE\\\"\\u003e,LC-SC3-CC-1-2018-2019-2020\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"mso-ansi-language:FR-BE\\\" lang\\u003d\\\"FR-BE\\\"\\u003e,LC-SC3-CC-2-2018\\u003c/span\\u003e,LC-SC3-CC-5-2018,LC-SC3-CC-6-2018\\u003c!--[if gte mso 9]\\u003e\\u003cxml\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:WordDocument\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:View\\u003eNormal\\u003c/w:View\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:Zoom\\u003e0\\u003c/w:Zoom\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:TrackMoves /\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:TrackFormatting /\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:PunctuationKerning /\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:ValidateAgainstSchemas /\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:SaveIfXMLInvalid\\u003efalse\\u003c/w:SaveIfXMLInvalid\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:IgnoreMixedContent\\u003efalse\\u003c/w:IgnoreMixedContent\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:AlwaysShowPlaceholderText\\u003efalse\\u003c/w:AlwaysShowPlaceholderText\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:DoNotPromoteQF /\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:LidThemeOther\\u003eEN-GB\\u003c/w:LidThemeOther\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:LidThemeAsian\\u003eX-NONE\\u003c/w:LidThemeAsian\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:LidThemeComplexScript\\u003eX-NONE\\u003c/w:LidThemeComplexScript\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:Compatibility\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:BreakWrappedTables /\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cw:SnapToGridInCell /\\u003e\\r\\n\\u00