11:00:24 AM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eOn 11 December 2018, a total of 72 proposals were submitted in response to the following 2019 topics:\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003eLC-SC3-RES-8-2019: 18 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space:pre\\\"\\u003e\\t\\t\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003eLC-SC3-RES-17-2019: 14 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space:pre\\\"\\u003e\\t\\t\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003eLC-SC3-RES-15-2019: 12 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space:pre\\\"\\u003e\\t\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003eLC-SC3-RES-30-2019: 7 proposals\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003eLC-SC3-RES-24-2019: 2 proposals\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"white-space:pre\\\"\\u003e\\t\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003eLC-SC3-RES-28-2018-2019-2020: 19 proposals\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Nov 22, 2018 12:11:42 PM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Nov 22, 2018 12:11:42 PM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePlease note that the latest information on results (\\u003cstrong\\u003eFlash Call Info\\u003c/strong\\u003e)   of the \\u003cstrong\\u003esecond stage\\u003c/strong\\u003e    evaluation for topics LC-SC3-RES-4-2018 and LC-SC3-RES-11-2018 (that  closed  on 28 August 2018) can  be  found in the  \\u0026quot;Additional Documents\\u0026quot;  section of  the relevant topics.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Nov 16, 2018 3:28:50 PM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Nov 16, 2018 3:28:50 PM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003ePlease note that the latest information on results (\\u003cstrong\\u003eFlash Call Info\\u003c/strong\\u003e)   of the \\u003cstrong\\u003esingle stage\\u003c/strong\\u003e    evaluation for topics LC-SC3-RES-2-2018, and LC-SC3-CC-4-2018 (that  closed  on 19 April 2018),  and for the topics LC-SC3-JA-1-2018, and LC-SC3-JA-2-2018 (that  closed  on 11 September 2018) can  be  found in the  \\u0026quot;Additional Documents\\u0026quot;  section of  the relevant topics.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Nov 14, 2018 12:30:18 AM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Nov 14, 2018 12:30:18 AM\",\"content\":\"The submission session is now available for: LC-SC3-CC-3-2019(CSA), LC-SC3-JA-3-2019(PCP), LC-SC3-ES-9-2019(ERA-NET-Cofund), LC-SC3-JA-2-2018-2019(CSA)\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Oct 17, 2018 4:37:41 PM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Oct 17, 2018 4:37:41 PM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eOn 16 October 2018, a total of 164 proposals were submitted in response to the following 2019 topics:\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003eLC-SC3-RES-1\\u0026ndash;2019-2020 \\u0026ndash; 130 proposals\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv\\u003eLC-SC3-RES-14\\u0026ndash;2019 \\u0026ndash; 34 proposals\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003c/div\\u003e\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Oct 2, 2018 4:27:25 PM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Oct 2, 2018 4:27:25 PM\",\"content\":\"The submission session is now available for: LC-SC3-ES-6-2019(RIA), LC-SC3-ES-1-2019(IA), LC-SC3-ES-2-2019(IA), LC-SC3-SCC-1-2018-2019-2020(IA), LC-SC3-ES-8-2019(CSA)\"},{\"approvalDate\":\"Sep 14, 2018 2:05:01 PM\",\"lastChangeDate\":\"Sep 14, 2018 2:05:01 PM\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cspan style\\u003d\\\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: \\u0026quot;Arial\\u0026quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \\u0026quot;Times New Roman\\u0026quot;; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB\\\"\\u003eCall deadline of 13 September 2018, 189 proposals submitted, as follows:\\u003co:p\\u003e\\u003c/o:p\\u003e\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0